cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DQ Dental CAD (Dental-CAD-Designer)"
abstract: >-
  Standalone dental CAD web application for viewing intraoral scans
  (STL/PLY) and designing crowns, inlays/onlays and bridges, built on a
  deterministic Float64 TypeScript geometry kernel with QC gates that block
  export and independent server-side re-validation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dul
    given-names: Zoltán
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZoliQua/Dental-CAD-Designer"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - dental CAD
  - crown
  - bridge
  - inlay
  - onlay
  - geometry kernel
  - STL
